From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: alt+tab switcher closes reliably on fast taps

Hyprland 0.57 never delivers the `ALT + Alt_L` release binds, so the switcher
only closed on Esc.

- Close (and switch) when the focused switch window sees the modifier released.
- On a fast tap the modifier is already up before the window is focused: once
  the window is active, check the seat's modifier state and close if not held.
- Don't make the open binds repeating, so holding tab after releasing alt does
  not reopen the switcher.

Applies on top of hyprshell-hyprland-0.57-compat.patch. Not compiled or tested.
---
